sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Gateway as Gateway API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant KRBAC as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>(sidecar)
    participant OGX as OGX Server<br/>8321/TCP HTTP
    participant PostgreSQL as PostgreSQL<br/>5432/TCP
    participant vLLM_Inf as vLLM Inference<br/>HTTP/HTTPS
    participant vLLM_Emb as vLLM Embedding<br/>HTTP/HTTPS
    participant VectorDB as Vector Store<br/>(Milvus/pgvector/Qdrant)
    participant ToolRT as Tool Runtime<br/>(Brave/Tavily/MCP)<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant CloudLLM as Cloud LLM Provider<br/>(Bedrock/WatsonX/Azure/<br/>Vertex/OpenAI/Gemini/Anthropic)

    Note over Client,OGX: Flow 1: Inference Request (Chat Completions)
    Client->>Gateway: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>HTTPS/443, TLS 1.2+
    Gateway->>KRBAC: Forward (TLS terminated)
    KRBAC->>OGX: HTTP/8321<br/>Auth: OAuth2 JWT (conditional)
    OGX->>OGX: Validate JWT via JWKS<br/>(if AUTH_ISSUER set)
    OGX->>vLLM_Inf: Forward inference request<br/>HTTP/HTTPS, Bearer token
    vLLM_Inf-->>OGX: Inference response
    OGX->>PostgreSQL: Store conversation state<br/>PostgreSQL/5432, Password auth
    PostgreSQL-->>OGX: Ack
    OGX-->>KRBAC: JSON response
    KRBAC-->>Gateway: Forward
    Gateway-->>Client: HTTPS response

    Note over Client,VectorDB: Flow 2: RAG File Ingestion
    Client->>Gateway: POST /v1/files<br/>HTTPS/443, TLS 1.2+
    Gateway->>KRBAC: Forward
    KRBAC->>OGX: HTTP/8321, OAuth2 JWT
    OGX->>OGX: Save file to local filesystem<br/>/opt/app-root/src/.ogx/distributions/rh/files
    OGX->>PostgreSQL: Store file metadata<br/>(files_metadata table)
    PostgreSQL-->>OGX: Ack
    OGX-->>Client: File ID response

    Client->>Gateway: POST /v1/vector_stores<br/>HTTPS/443
    Gateway->>KRBAC: Forward
    KRBAC->>OGX: HTTP/8321, OAuth2 JWT
    OGX->>vLLM_Emb: Generate embeddings<br/>HTTP/HTTPS, Bearer token
    vLLM_Emb-->>OGX: Embedding vectors
    OGX->>VectorDB: Store vectors<br/>TLS (configurable), Token/API key
    VectorDB-->>OGX: Ack
    OGX-->>Client: Vector store response

    Note over Client,ToolRT: Flow 3: Agentic Workflow (Responses API)
    Client->>Gateway: POST /v1/responses<br/>HTTPS/443, TLS 1.2+
    Gateway->>KRBAC: Forward
    KRBAC->>OGX: HTTP/8321, OAuth2 JWT
    OGX->>CloudLLM: Inference request<br/>HTTPS/443, TLS 1.2+<br/>Provider-specific auth
    CloudLLM-->>OGX: Response with tool calls
    OGX->>ToolRT: Execute tool<br/>HTTPS/443, API key
    ToolRT-->>OGX: Tool results
    OGX->>CloudLLM: Follow-up with tool results
    CloudLLM-->>OGX: Final response
    OGX->>PostgreSQL: Store agent state & responses<br/>PostgreSQL/5432, Password
    PostgreSQL-->>OGX: Ack
    OGX-->>Client: Streaming/final response
